# PersianScribe for Apple Silicon

[English](README.md) | [فارسی](README.fa.md)

A local Persian speech-to-text pipeline for Apple Silicon Macs, with speaker diarization and conservative automatic transcript correction.

## What it does

The pipeline automatically:

- prepares audio/video with FFmpeg;
- transcribes Persian speech and generates timing information with MLX Whisper;
- detects speakers with pyannote Community-1;
- merges speaker labels with transcript timestamps;
- compares transcription/correction candidates;
- applies conservative automatic correction;
- writes results to the `Output` directory.

The workflow is designed for unattended processing; manual listening or word-by-word approval is not required.

### Conservative correction

Correction is intentionally cautious. If there is not enough evidence to safely change a word or phrase, the original transcription is kept instead of guessing.

